jit-parser

    A recursive descent parser with JIT compiler.


rdesc?

    I do experiments on this repository and they are not for production. I
wanted to add JIT to rdesc VM, but to clarify the algorithm I created this
*testing* project.


Building

    Currently, only ARM platform back end is implemented. You can directly
build this project using `make -j` if you are on ARM. To cross-compile from
another CPU architecture, you can install GNU ARM cross-compiler, and execute

                # vvv your operating system's ARM cross-compiler
    export CC=arm-linux-gnueabi-gcc
    export AR=arm-linux-gnueabi-ar
    make -j
